<item><title>Sierra Leone cement maker ROCKCEM invests $60 million in processing and distribution</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/sl/sierra-leone-cement-maker-rockcem-invests-60-million-in-f933b4/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/sl/sierra-leone-cement-maker-rockcem-invests-60-million-in-f933b4/</guid><category>Sierra Leone</category><description>The company is building a warehouse in Songo and a grinding mill designed to produce more than 60,000 bags a day.</description><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 09:28:27 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/sl/sierra-leone-cement-maker-rockcem-invests-60-million-in-f933b4/share.jpg" length="44026" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/sl/sierra-leone-cement-maker-rockcem-invests-60-million-in-f933b4/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
